---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <Nav activePage="career-guidance" />

  <section id="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="orb orb-gold"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-teal"></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance">Career Counselling and Guidance</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Career Guidance</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="pill hero-pill">
        <span class="pill-dot"></span>
        Career guidance that goes beyond generic advice.
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Career guidance
        <span class="gold-text"> for practical direction, not generic advice</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Career guidance should move you from confusion to a decision you can act on before the next wrong turn gets expensive.
        Future Career School builds that direction around a high-value, high-income skill portfolio — proof of work, positioning, and stronger income logic that unlock high income opportunities and put earlier financial freedom within reach.
        This is a practical career guidance service, not generic motivational talk.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-note">
        Guidance is available fully online across India. Start from home, college, work, or wherever you already are — no travel, no waiting for local availability.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-gold pulse">Get Student Career Guidance</a>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-outline">Get Working Professional Career Guidance</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-support">
        Skill direction and proof of work move faster than motivation alone — that is what a stronger skill portfolio is built on.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="what-you-get"
    title="What strong career guidance should give you"
    subtitle="Generic course advice is not the point. A high-value, high-income skill portfolio, proof of work, and stronger positioning are what unlock high income opportunities and clearer income growth."
    items={deliverableItems}
    columns={3}
    variant="signal"
  >
      <AssessmentSupportNote
        body="The free career and skill assessments can surface strengths, preferences, and work style before you commit to a bigger guidance decision."
        href={BOFU_ASSESSMENT_LINKS.hub}
      />
  </BofuFeatureSection>

  <ComparisonMatrix
    sectionId="different"
    title="Why this is more useful than generic career advice"
    subtitle="The point is clearer skill direction, proof of work, stronger income-growth logic, and a clearer route toward achieving earlier financial freedom."
  />

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="fit"
    title="When career guidance becomes useful"
    subtitle="Career guidance matters when the next move feels important, expensive, delayed by confusion, or no longer solvable through generic internet advice. The goal is to get clearer before another wrong turn costs more time, money, or effort."
    items={fitItems}
    variant="contrast"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={fitSummaryItems} variant="contrast" />
  </BofuListCardSection>

  <ContextualCta
    audience="mixed"
    title="Use career guidance before broad confusion turns into a more expensive commitment"
    body="It helps most when the real problem is no longer lack of information but weak trade-offs, unclear skill direction, and a next move that still does not feel solid."
    studentHref="#plans"
    studentLabel="Get Student Career Guidance"
    professionalHref="#plans"
    professionalLabel="Get Working Professional Career Guidance"
  />

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="what-guidance-should-do"
    title="What career guidance should actually help you do"
    subtitle="Good career guidance does not stop at path labels or motivational talk. The chain is simple: the right skill portfolio unlocks high income opportunities, and higher income is what buys earlier financial freedom."
    items={whatGuidanceItems}
    variant="signal"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={whatGuidanceSummaryItems} variant="signal" />
  </BofuFeatureSection>

  <GuidanceModelSection />

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="good-first-session"
    title="What better career guidance should change after the first clarity layer"
    subtitle="The useful question is not whether someone talked to you. The useful question is whether the guidance improved decision quality enough to make the next move clearer, smaller, and safer."
    items={firstLayerItems}
    variant="decision"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={firstLayerSummaryItems} variant="contrast" />
  </BofuFeatureSection>

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="session-fit"
    title="What better guidance should improve after the first clarity layer"
    subtitle="Clearer direction is only the start. Better guidance should also improve the quality of the path you choose next."
    items={sessionFitItems}
    variant="contrast"
  />

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="broader-guidance"
    title="When career guidance solves a broader problem than one decision"
    subtitle="Sometimes the confusion is not only about one next choice. They are trying to solve a wider direction problem that touches path fit, skill direction, and execution risk at the same time."
    items={broaderGuidanceItems}
    variant="prep"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={broaderGuidanceSummaryItems} variant="neutral" />
  </BofuFeatureSection>

  <AudienceRelevance title="How the right support can fit where you are right now" />

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="objections"
    title="Common doubts before starting career guidance"
    subtitle="These are common doubts worth resolving before paying for any guidance service."
    items={objectionItems}
    variant="signal"
  />

  <BuyerChecks
    title="What to check before paying any career guidance service"
    subtitle="Good career guidance should improve decision quality. It should not leave you paying for more confusion, more generic advice, or a path that still feels random."
    items={buyerCheckItems}
  />

  <ContextualCta
    audience="mixed"
    title="If the next move still feels vague after everything you have already read, this is where stronger direction matters"
    body="A useful guidance process should narrow the real problem, improve the trade-offs, and leave you with a next step worth acting on."
    studentHref="#plans"
    studentLabel="Get Student Career Guidance"
    professionalHref="#plans"
    professionalLabel="Get Working Professional Career Guidance"
  />

  <GuidancePlansSection
    audience="mixed"
    serviceLabel="Career Guidance"
  />

  <LinkDirectorySection
    sectionId="related-links"
    title="Explore related help"
    subtitle="See other guidance pages, assessments, tools, and useful reading before you decide."
    items={relatedDirectoryItems}
    altBackground={true}
  />

  <BofuFaqSection title="Questions people ask before choosing career guidance" items={faqItems} />

  <FinalCta
    audience="mixed"
    title="Build the skill portfolio that unlocks high income opportunities"
    subtitle="Move now if the next decision is already costing you clarity, time, or a stronger path toward earlier financial freedom."
    studentHref="#plans"
    studentLabel="Get Student Career Guidance"
    professionalHref="#plans"
    professionalLabel="Get Working Professional Career Guidance"
  />

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  section { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  section[id] { scroll-margin-top: 108px; }
  #hero { padding: 138px 0 82px; }
  .hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; }
  .orb { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(120px); pointer-events: none; }
  .orb-gold { width: 520px; height: 520px; top: -160px; left: -110px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(229,184,74,.18), transparent 70%); }
  .orb-teal { width: 420px; height: 420px; top: -40px; right: -120px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(45,212,191,.11), transparent 70%); }
  .grid {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,.06) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 80px 80px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 10%, rgba(0,0,0,.8), transparent 60%);
    opacity: .16;
  }
  .hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .breadcrumb { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.38); margin-bottom: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); transition: color .2s; }
  .breadcrumb a:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,.85); }
  .hero-pill { width: fit-content; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .pill-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .hero-title { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.8rem); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -.04em; color: #fff; max-width: 980px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .hero-sub { font-size: clamp(15px, 1.9vw, 18px); color: rgba(255,255,255,.68); line-height: 1.8; max-width: 780px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .hero-note { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.56); line-height: 1.75; max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 1.8rem; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .hero-support { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.58); line-height: 1.8; max-width: 720px; margin-top: 1rem; }

